  "summary": "I ran CRC outreach for \"Okafor CRC 2026\" (14 patients) under RBC-QM-02. Six patients had open gaps: each got a mailed FIT kit order and an outreach message about it. A seventh open gap (pt-0024) already had an active FIT order, so I placed no second order.\n\nMeasurement period is 2026; ages are as of 2026-12-31. The new FIT orders run 2026-10-23 to 2026-12-31.\n\n| Patient | Age | Status | Reason / action |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| pt-0009 Elly Trantow | 72 | Excluded | Age 66 or older, frailty active since 2025-09, and a dementia medication (donepezil, ordered 2025-06-10). No outreach. |\n| pt-0011 Marilu Gaona | 76 | Not in population | Older than 75 at the end of 2026. |\n| pt-0014 Santo Pagac | 55 | Screening up to date | Colonoscopy 2018-05-21, within the 2017–2026 lookback. |\n| pt-0017 Stephan Herman | 54 | Open gap | Only colonoscopy was 2016-11-15, before the 2017 lookback start. FIT ordered (sr-t0001), patient messaged (comm-t0007). |\n| pt-0018 Lance Muller | 53 | Open gap | Only stool DNA-FIT test was 2023-11-20, before the 2024–2026 lookback. FIT ordered (sr-t0002), patient messaged (comm-t0008). |\n| pt-0019 Harrison O'Keefe | 69 | Open gap | No screening on record. Has frailty, but no advanced illness or dementia medication, so not excluded. FIT ordered (sr-t0003), patient messaged (comm-t0009). |\n| pt-0020 Kelsie Rohan | 52 | Excluded | In hospice care since 2026-08-20 (pancreatic cancer). No outreach. |\n| pt-0021 Ángela Vigil | 52 | Excluded | Total proctocolectomy in 2015 (outside operative report). No outreach. |\n| pt-0022 Tiny Koss | 52 | Open gap | Last FIT was 2025-12-03; a FIT only counts in the measurement year. FIT ordered (sr-t0004), patient messaged (comm-t0010). |\n| pt-0023 Burma Leuschke | 46 | Open gap | No screening on record. FIT ordered (sr-t0005), patient messaged (comm-t0011). |\n| pt-0024 Delaine MacGyver | 51 | Open gap, FIT already ordered | Only stool blood test was 2024-06-11, outside 2026. FIT order sr-t3-6648 (placed 2026-09-30) is still active, so no new order. I found no outreach message tied to that order and did not send one. |\n| pt-0025 Danika Ullrich | 51 | Screening up to date | CT colonography 2022-03-08, within the 2022–2026 lookback. |\n| pt-0034 Rickey Sipes | 72 | Excluded | Age 66 or older and living long term in a nursing home (housing status 2026-02-10, nursing facility visits after his 2025-12 stroke). No outreach. |\n| pt-0035 Elvin Wolff | 68 | Open gap | No screening on record. His May 2026 skilled nursing stay was short-term rehab; he lives at home and has no frailty diagnosis, so not excluded. FIT ordered (sr-t0006), patient messaged (comm-t0012). |\n\nDecision for you: pt-0024's open FIT order has had no message attached that I could find. Staff may want to send her a reminder.",
